1
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,656
《星际迷航：新世界》前情提要
Previously on Star Trek: Strange New Worlds...

2
00:00:22,656 --> 00:00:24,825
这是科尔比博士
This is Dr. Korby.

3
00:00:24,825 --> 00:00:27,195
一开始她只是学生 但事情很快发生了变化
At first she was a fellow, but she quickly became more.

4
00:00:27,295 --> 00:00:29,963
她和我之前一块在瓦迪亚九星管理考古发掘点
She was running the excavation site on Vadia Nine with me.

5
00:00:30,064 --> 00:00:31,532
瓦肯人有一种古代技艺
Vulcans have an ancient technique

6
00:00:31,665 --> 00:00:32,665
能通过冥想来调节疼痛
of regulating pain through meditation.

7
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,004
当我们心灵融合的时候
When we joined minds,

8
00:00:37,105 --> 00:00:38,139
我吸纳了您的痛苦
I absorbed your pain.

9
00:00:38,239 --> 00:00:39,440
我看到了什么
I saw something.

10
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,040
它感觉既像是您的一部分 又不是
It felt both a part of you and not.

11
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:41,842
是戈恩吗
Was it Gorn?

12
00:00:41,842 --> 00:00:45,400
我认为这种愿意尝试新事物的态度非常适合你
This openness to new life experiences suits you.

13
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,814
好吧 这是谁
Okay. Who's this?

14
00:00:46,814 --> 00:00:48,100
我弟弟
My little brother.

15
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,217
星际舰队公关部
Starfleet's Public Relations.

16
00:00:49,217 --> 00:00:50,618
有意向让我拍一部
They may commission

17
00:00:50,618 --> 00:00:52,386
星际舰队的纪录片电影
a feature-length documentary of Starfleet.

18
00:01:00,395 --> 00:01:02,029
初级医疗官日志
Junior medical officer's log,

19
00:01:02,029 --> 00:01:04,165
星历2184.4
stardate 2184.4.

20
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:07,668
联邦星舰进取号报告
Reporting from the USS Enterprise.

21
00:01:07,735 --> 00:01:09,270
进取号这个词
Enterprise.

22
00:01:09,403 --> 00:01:11,972
我怎么说都说不厌
I will never get tired of saying that.

23
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:15,243
能在这里任职六个月简直太棒了
The last six months stationed here have been awesome.

24
00:01:15,376 --> 00:01:17,545
今天我也像往常一样
Today started out like any other day here,

25
00:01:17,611 --> 00:01:19,513
在医务室工作着
me working in sickbay.

26
00:01:20,348 --> 00:01:22,116
但我知道过完今天
But after today

27
00:01:22,216 --> 00:01:25,085
我的生活将被彻底改变
I know my life is never gonna be the same again.

28
00:01:26,287 --> 00:01:28,656
噢 真激动 可不是吗
Oh. Exciting, isn't it?

29
00:01:28,656 --> 00:01:31,125
是啊 如果你对这个课题感兴趣
Yeah, if you're into that sort of thing.

30
00:01:32,394 --> 00:01:36,197
查普尔护士和科尔比博士就要创下历史了
Nurse Chapel and Dr. Korby are about to make history.

31
00:01:36,197 --> 00:01:39,098
嗯 这可能会改变我们对生死的认知
Well, this could change the way we view mortality.

32
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,934
以及科尔比对分子存储器和
And Korby's work on molecular memory

33
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:42,470
转移实体的研究
and corporeal transference.

34
00:01:42,603 --> 00:01:44,771
甚至古人痴迷的那些
The idea that ancient man's fascination

35
00:01:44,872 --> 00:01:46,440
所谓复活与轮回论
with resurrection and reincarnation

36
00:01:46,539 --> 00:01:48,776
居然其实是被人遗忘的古老科技吗 你看这
could all be based on forgotten technology? I mean...

37
00:01:48,908 --> 00:01:50,978
如果你对这个课题感兴趣
If you're into that sort of thing.

38
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,900
我只是看过他的一些论文
I may have read some of his papers.

39
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:56,860
我需要考虑把你转配到考古医学部吗
Should I expect a transfer request from you to archaeological medicine?

40
00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:57,800
千万别
Never.

41
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:00,340
我是说 去古老的星球上挖土
I mean, as fun as it sounds to dig up old worlds

42
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:02,223
寻找尘封的古代医疗技术是有意思
and find lost medical science,

43
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:03,520
但我更喜欢现在的岗位
I like where I'm at.

44
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,620
那么 如果你也想创造历史
Well, you can make your own mark on history

45
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:08,329
你可以赶紧趁着巴特尔舰长还没来
by charging the dermal wands at all the biobed stations

46
00:02:08,329 --> 00:02:11,199
先去给生物床里所有的真皮再生器充能
before Captain Batel gets here for her treatment.

47
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,833
收到长官 这就去
Gotcha, sir. On it.

48
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:21,309
你确定进取号的偏导阵列
You're sure the Enterprise's deflector array

49
00:02:21,309 --> 00:02:23,211
不会压掉那片磁场异象吗
won't overpower the magnetic anomaly?

50
00:02:23,211 --> 00:02:26,820
我到底需要向你保证多少次不会出事的
How many times do I have to promise you it's all gonna be fine?

51
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:27,615
我知道 我知道
I know. I know.

52
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,083
你有没有和派克说过 这个地方对当地人
You, uh, you let Pike know how-how sacred this place was

53
00:02:30,083 --> 00:02:31,440
来说是非常神圣的
to the people here, right?

54
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,780
你真以为星际舰队
Do you really think

55
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,855
会过去随意搞事 肆意挥舞相位枪
that Starfleet is just gonna waltz on in there,

56
00:02:34,855 --> 00:02:37,300
到头来夷平一个文化遗址吗
phasers blasting, and obliterate a heritage site?

57
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:38,960
呃 不觉得
Uh, no.

58
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,661
但这也不能怪我吧 我是说
But-but-but can you blame me? I mean...

59
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,497
有些时候习惯于发号施令的人
sometimes people that-that are used to giving orders struggle

60
00:02:43,497 --> 00:02:45,220
轮到他们接受命令时就会犯难
when-when receiving them, huh?

61
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,540
天哪 你可说到点子上了
God, you're so right.

62
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:48,402
我都想去给派克舰长来一针
I'm just gonna go and hypospray Captain Pike

63
00:02:48,402 --> 00:02:50,780
这样他就不会把差事都往咱们身上扔了
so he doesn't give us, like, any trouble at all.

64
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:53,106
多少剂量的塔拉嗪才不致死来着
How much Tarazine is sublethal?

65
00:02:53,207 --> 00:02:55,175
我老是记错这些数字
Just always get the numbers all mixed-up.

66
00:02:55,309 --> 00:02:56,744
笑我很好玩吧
You having fun?

67
00:02:56,844 --> 00:02:58,546
要不给他一枪爆头算了
Maybe just a blow to the head?

68
00:02:58,646 --> 00:03:00,281
指令功能是左半脑负责 对吧
Command function's left lobe, right?

69
00:03:00,381 --> 00:03:01,715
嗯哼 嗯哼
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

70
00:03:01,815 --> 00:03:03,517
好吧 听着 我可能是有点偏执了
Okay, look, maybe I'm being a little paranoid.

71
00:03:03,651 --> 00:03:05,586
你吗 亲爱的
Oh, you, my dear?

72
00:03:05,686 --> 00:03:07,087
才没有
Never.

73
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,060
好吧
Okay.

74
00:03:08,489 --> 00:03:10,291
我知道为了说服派克舰长帮忙
I know how much work you've, you've put in,

75
00:03:10,358 --> 00:03:12,993
你做出了多大的努力
lobbying Captain Pike to help.

76
00:03:13,093 --> 00:03:14,828
要是没有星舰
There's just no getting below

77
00:03:14,928 --> 00:03:16,430
我们可没法下到星球表面
the planet's surface without a starship.

78
00:03:16,530 --> 00:03:18,499
我的感激难以言表
And I am more than grateful.

79
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,134
-我只是经常在开工之前 -你总是在开工之前
-It's just that I always get nervous... -You always get nervous

80
00:03:21,235 --> 00:03:22,703
感到紧张
...before a dig.

81
00:03:24,538 --> 00:03:25,839
我知道
I know.

82
00:03:29,744 --> 00:03:31,679
一会见 罗杰
I'll see you soon, Roger.

83
00:03:31,679 --> 00:03:33,146
好 会见的
Yes, you will.

84
00:03:33,705 --> 00:03:34,640
动作快点
Hurry down.

85
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,716
别让我等太久
Don't make me wait.

86
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,623
查普尔
Chapel.

87
00:03:42,623 --> 00:03:44,425
呃 问一句
Uh, quick question.

88
00:03:45,893 --> 00:03:47,495
史波克现在怎么样
How's Spock doing?

89
00:03:48,362 --> 00:03:49,363
应该还好吧
Fine?

90
00:03:49,463 --> 00:03:51,164
今天我没见着他
I haven't seen him today.

91
00:03:51,265 --> 00:03:54,635
他有说什么关于罗杰的事吗
Has he, uh, said anything about Roger being here?

92
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,481
呃
Um...

93
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,273
你看 我知道你们俩
I mean, I know you guys have been...

94
00:03:59,373 --> 00:04:01,241
最近几个月
spending more time, getting closer

95
00:04:01,241 --> 00:04:02,720
-走的还挺近的 -噢不
-these last months. -Oh. No.

96
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:04,244
求你别跟其他女人一样当醋坛子
No, please don't be one of those women.

97
00:04:04,345 --> 00:04:05,613
这就是为什么我不谈恋爱
This is why I don't do this.

98
00:04:05,713 --> 00:04:07,315
我吗 不是不是
Oh, me? No. Oh.

99
00:04:07,415 --> 00:04:09,249
才不是
Heck no.

100
00:04:09,350 --> 00:04:10,684
我不介意
I'm good.

101
00:04:11,127 --> 00:04:12,286
史波克和我明确地谈过
Spock and I made it very clear with each other.

102
00:04:12,286 --> 00:04:15,756
不要互贴标签 不要把对方期望得太高
No labels, no complicated expectations.

103
00:04:15,889 --> 00:04:17,257
只要过得开心就好
Just fun times.

104
00:04:18,404 --> 00:04:19,500
拜托 别把事情又弄麻烦了
Please don't make it weird.

105
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,042
这样你真的能接受吗
Uh, y-you're good with that?

106
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,280
听着 如果你真的担心
Look, if you're really worried about 

107
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,160
史波克会不会去骚扰科尔比 你可以直接问他
Spock behaving around Korby, then just ask him.

108
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,480
毕竟我们都是成年人了
We're all adults here, right?

109
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,104
对
Yeah.

110
00:04:31,238 --> 00:04:32,640
好吧
Okay.

111
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,381
实在不可思议 史波克的才智加上
It's amazing. With Spock's brain,

112
00:04:40,381 --> 00:04:43,050
姆'本加的研究 和查普尔精湛的基因技术
M'Benga's research, and Chapel's genetic expertise,

113
00:04:43,116 --> 00:04:44,217
说实话 这真是
frankly, it's a...

114
00:04:44,217 --> 00:04:45,739
别说这是奇迹
Don't say "miracle."

115
00:04:45,739 --> 00:04:46,700
好吧
Okay.

116
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,635
尖端科学的硕果
Top-notch science.

117
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,624
我最喜欢的病人怎么样啦
How's my favorite patient doing?

118
00:04:50,724 --> 00:04:52,326
挺好的
Great, actually.

119
00:04:52,426 --> 00:04:53,727
谢谢你 约瑟夫
Thank you, Joseph.

120
00:04:53,827 --> 00:04:55,228
为了你所做的一切
What you've done here,

121
00:04:55,329 --> 00:04:57,531
我欠你个大人情
I owe it to all of you.

122
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,835
真皮再生器怎么样了
How are the dermal wands looking?

123
00:05:01,835 --> 00:05:02,936
一切就绪 长官
All accounted for, sir.

124
00:05:02,936 --> 00:05:04,540
所有生物床都充好能了
Every biobed station fully charged.

125
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,006
远程同步器呢
And the remote synthesizers?

126
00:05:06,106 --> 00:05:08,208
我就知道你会问 所以我把它们也重新充能了
I thought you would ask, so I recharged them, too.

127
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,644
很好 那你就不会迟到了
Good. So you won't be late.

128
00:05:10,744 --> 00:05:12,012
呃 迟到什么
Uh, late for what?

129
00:05:12,112 --> 00:05:13,881
任务简报
The mission brief.

130
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:16,460
外勤队成员都要去开会
The landing party's meeting soon.

131
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:17,651
什么外勤队
The landing party?

132
00:05:17,751 --> 00:05:19,119
瓦迪亚九星的外勤队吗
On Vadia Nine?

133
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:23,724
你不是已经请求过六次加入外勤队了吗
You've requested away team assignment six times.

134
00:05:24,692 --> 00:05:26,660
你值得的
You've earned it.

135
00:05:27,428 --> 00:05:29,663
别让我在科尔比博士面前丢脸就行
Just don't embarrass me with Dr. Korby.

136
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:37,313
抱歉 我只是太激动了
I'm sorry. I'm just so excited.

137
00:05:37,313 --> 00:05:38,080
走吧
Go.

138
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,749
要不然他们可不等你了
They'll start without you.

139
00:05:45,238 --> 00:05:46,940
这是第一个正式
My first official research mission

140
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:48,382
交给我的外星研究任务
on an alien planet.

141
00:05:48,482 --> 00:05:49,817
这可是自我进入星际舰队学院以来
I've been dreaming of this since I was first accepted

142
00:05:49,883 --> 00:05:51,784
就梦寐以求的事情
to Starfleet Academy.

143
00:05:51,885 --> 00:05:53,954
而现在正是我大展拳脚的时候了
And now it's my time to shine.

144
00:06:03,797 --> 00:06:05,433
史波克少校
Lieutenant Spock.

145
00:06:10,871 --> 00:06:15,843
为什么每次我们需要谈谈的时候你总是这么安静
Why are we always so quiet when we need to talk?

146
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,868
有什么需要谈的吗
Is there something to discuss?

147
00:06:18,746 --> 00:06:20,013
我呢
I am...

148
00:06:20,013 --> 00:06:23,617
很高兴看到你和努尼恩辛格上尉
glad to see you and Lieutenant Noonien-Singh

149
00:06:23,617 --> 00:06:25,353
在一起待的时间更久了
spending more time together.

150
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:30,929
她是一位优秀的舞蹈老师
She is an excellent dance instructor.

151
00:06:31,859 --> 00:06:33,326
这也很好啊
That, too.

152
00:06:37,598 --> 00:06:38,932
呃
Um...

153
00:06:38,932 --> 00:06:41,835
罗杰对发掘工作有些紧张
Roger's... feeling nervous about the dig.

154
00:06:42,299 --> 00:06:43,600
然后 呃
And, um...

155
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,372
就是 我知道你们俩现在差不多 交上朋友了
you know, I know you guys are, like, friends now...

156
00:06:45,372 --> 00:06:46,907
相对来说没错
A relative term.

157
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:51,280
我只想确保事情进展顺利 不要干扰到工作
I just want to be s-sure that things are gonna go smoothly down there.

158
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,100
你不信任我
You do not trust me.

159
00:06:53,747 --> 00:06:54,915
不用担心 克莉丝汀
Not to worry, Christine.

160
00:06:55,318 --> 00:06:57,120
我制定了必要的保障措施
I have instituted certain safeguards

161
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,819
来保证一切工作顺利进行
to ensure it will all go smoothly.

162
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:02,388
你这是什么意思 什么措施
What do you, what do you mean, "safeguards"?

163
00:07:05,292 --> 00:07:07,461
啊 太好了 同伴们
Ah, great! Crewmates!

164
00:07:10,230 --> 00:07:13,133
我不用一个人参加简报会啦
I don't have to go into the briefing alone.

165
00:07:16,369 --> 00:07:18,672
我是不是打扰你们说话了
I interrupted something, didn't I?

166
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:22,820
玛克戎人已经不止一次
The M'Kroon have declined Federation membership 

167
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:24,000
拒绝加入联邦了
 on multiple occasions,

168
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,120
所以他们只允许派出一个小型外勤队
which is why they're only allowing a small landing party.

169
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,881
好了 查普尔 你要先亲自上阵
All right, Chapel, you'll be boots on the ground.

170
00:07:27,948 --> 00:07:30,584
一旦信号增强器就位 就通知我们出发
Give us the go-ahead once the signal amplifiers are in place.

171
00:07:30,651 --> 00:07:33,600
科学小组的人已经调整好偏导阵列了吗
Has the science team finished adjusting the deflector arrays?

172
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,180
是的
Yes.

173
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:36,420
之后我会留驻在进取号上
And I will be monitoring the adjustments in real time,

174
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:38,220
实时监测这些调整的情况
here aboard the Enterprise.

175
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,620
留在舰上观测数据
Monitoring from the ship

176
00:07:40,620 --> 00:07:42,062
就是你的保障措施
as a safeguard.

177
00:07:42,129 --> 00:07:44,565
你不打算下到星球表面上
You're not coming down to the planet.

178
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:48,660
查普尔 这是你的任务 
Chapel, this is your mission. 

179
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:51,171
还有其他
Any last...

180
00:07:51,171 --> 00:07:53,106
想法或是想说的吗
thoughts or words?

181
00:07:53,106 --> 00:07:54,374
你能再讲一次吗
Could you do that again?

182
00:07:55,207 --> 00:07:57,144
奥特加斯先生
Mr. Ortegas.

183
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,749
抱歉 有子空间的静电干扰 我得调整一下
Sorry. I just needed to adjust for subspace static.

184
00:08:01,749 --> 00:08:03,200
-有点妨碍到我的 -奥特加斯先生
-It interferes with my... -Mr. Ortegas,

185
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,820
艾丽卡答应过你不会添麻烦的
Erica promised you wouldn't be a problem.

186
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:08,088
如果你保持安静 你会拍到更好的画面
You'll get better footage if you just keep it quiet.

187
00:08:08,989 --> 00:08:10,223
对不起
Sorry.

188
00:08:10,323 --> 00:08:11,825
年轻人
Young man,

189
00:08:11,925 --> 00:08:15,028
如果你在工程部有什么想了解的
if there is anything you want to see in Engineering,

190
00:08:15,162 --> 00:08:17,230
什么都行
anything at all,

191
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:19,466
我非常乐意能为你
I am more than comfortable

192
00:08:19,567 --> 00:08:20,868
上一上镜
around a camera.

193
00:08:20,868 --> 00:08:22,760
你知道的 佩利亚 咱们别鼓励这种
You know what, Pelia, let's not encourage...

194
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,004
甘布尔少尉
Ensign Gamble,

195
00:08:24,004 --> 00:08:28,175
能请你给我们读读任务简报的第一段吗
would you kindly read the first paragraph of our mission brief?

196
00:08:34,937 --> 00:08:37,340
「为了纪念联邦成立一百周年
"To commemorate the Federation's centennial,

197
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:39,640
纪录片制作人温贝多·奥特加斯
"documentarian Humberto Ortegas

198
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,260
已经获得了安全许可
"has been given security clearance

199
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:44,140
以便记录进取号最近执行的任务」
to record Enterprise's current roster of missions."

200
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:47,020
好吧 既然如此 我们就是绑在一根绳上的蚂蚱了
Okay, according to that, we're stuck with each other.

201
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:49,280
但希望你能尽量别让相机那么碍事
But maybe just try to keep the cameras out of the way.

202
00:08:51,732 --> 00:08:54,534
一起来发掘过去吧
Let's go dig up the past.

203
00:09:11,885 --> 00:09:13,253
奈杰尔
N'Jal.

204
00:09:15,956 --> 00:09:20,227
多谢你允许我们记录下这个
Thank you for allowing us to document this...

205
00:09:20,227 --> 00:09:21,595
历史性的时刻
historic occasion.

206
00:09:21,595 --> 00:09:23,931
幸会幸会 这是我的荣幸
It is such an honor to meet you.

207
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:29,963
我听说玛克戎人的声域十分奇特
I hear the M'Kroon have a unique vocal range.

208
00:09:31,204 --> 00:09:32,405
来吧
Come.

209
00:09:32,505 --> 00:09:33,540
让我给你瞧瞧
Let me show you.

210
00:09:33,607 --> 00:09:34,574
嗨
Hi.

211
00:09:34,675 --> 00:09:35,809
你还好吗
How are you?

212
00:09:35,909 --> 00:09:37,577
还不错
Good.

213
00:09:38,979 --> 00:09:40,213
这就是那个磁场异象吗
Our magnetic anomaly?

214
00:09:40,313 --> 00:09:41,749
你说得对 这个地方
You were right about this place.

215
00:09:41,849 --> 00:09:44,484
确实存在某种先进的技术
There is indeed some form of advanced technology

216
00:09:44,584 --> 00:09:46,586
就藏在我们脚下
hiding beneath us.

217
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,193
我们开始吧
Let's set up,

218
00:09:53,193 --> 00:09:54,720
看看它是什么
see what it is.

219
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,504
好啊
Okay.

220
00:10:05,572 --> 00:10:07,040
这东西让你忙了好久吧
They keep you busy, huh?

221
00:10:08,776 --> 00:10:10,744
我们平时一般没机会摆弄玩具
We don't all get to play with toys.

222
00:10:11,326 --> 00:10:12,960
来这里
Come here.

223
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,828
我给你看个东西
Let me show you something.

224
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,454
这个设备操作起来很简单
So, it's intuitive.

225
00:10:21,588 --> 00:10:24,224
人工智能镜头会追踪说话过程中动作和语调的变化
A.I. lenses track movement and inflections in speech

226
00:10:24,291 --> 00:10:26,226
记录下其中隐含的强烈情绪
that indicate strong emotions.

227
00:10:26,293 --> 00:10:29,029
它能记录下言外之意的暗示吗
Uh, it clocks nonverbal cues?

228
00:10:29,129 --> 00:10:31,331
它总是会寻找各种隐台词 激烈的情绪
It's always looking for the subtext, the heat.

229
00:10:32,165 --> 00:10:33,967
也许正是因此 它聚焦在我们身上了
Could be why it's focused on us right now.

230
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:41,809
搞定了 乌乎拉
Done here. Uhura.

231
00:10:41,809 --> 00:10:43,160
你们那边进展怎样
How's it going over there?

232
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:52,359
完成啦
Finished.

233
00:10:53,586 --> 00:10:57,524
查普尔呼叫舰桥 传输塔已部署
Chapel to the bridge. The pylons are set.

234
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,420
随时待命
Ready when you are.

235
00:10:59,420 --> 00:11:01,895
收到 准备接收偏导波束
Copy. Stand by for deflector beams.

236
00:11:20,580 --> 00:11:23,416
舰长 我们需要规模更大的外勤队
Captain, we're gonna need a bigger landing party.

237
00:13:24,804 --> 00:13:25,873
我就知道你会下来
I knew you'd have to come down

238
00:13:25,973 --> 00:13:27,240
亲自看看这些的
and see this all for yourself.

239
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,609
我跟你说啥来着 你欠我一顿酒
What'd I tell you? You owe me a drink.

240
00:13:33,146 --> 00:13:35,949
玛克戎人否决了我们增员的请求
The M'Kroons vetoed our request to send more personnel,

241
00:13:36,016 --> 00:13:38,085
所以只有史波克和我来了
so Spock and I are the only ones coming.

242
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:39,719
明白了
Copy that.

243
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:43,356
我们找到了一个访问面板
Uh, we found an access panel

244
00:13:43,490 --> 00:13:45,092
上面有不明语言的字符
with symbols in an unknown language.

245
00:13:46,626 --> 00:13:47,995
这些字符是操作界面吗
These symbols are the interface?

246
00:13:48,095 --> 00:13:51,164
也许吧 或者是使用说明
Maybe. Or instructions.

247
00:13:51,264 --> 00:13:52,332
又或者是一种警告
Or a warning.

248
00:13:52,432 --> 00:13:53,833
看起来和玛克戎字母
They have a remarkable similarity

249
00:13:53,934 --> 00:13:55,035
有相当高的相似性
to the M'Kroonian alphabet.

250
00:13:55,135 --> 00:13:56,236
所以 五年前
So, five years ago,

251
00:13:56,336 --> 00:13:58,271
我在几百万光年之外的地方
hundreds of light-years from here,

252
00:13:58,338 --> 00:14:00,673
发现了这个
I discovered this.

253
00:14:00,673 --> 00:14:03,076
我觉得这个标记是皇室的象征
I believe it is a royal insignia.

254
00:14:03,076 --> 00:14:04,677
所以这地方可能是
So this place could be

255
00:14:04,677 --> 00:14:08,280
某种神庙或者宫殿
some sort of temple or palace.

256
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:10,820
我只知道 这只戒指是在北极星十二号找到的
All I know is, I found this ring on Polaris 12.

257
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:13,153
但是普莱托利安也上有相似的几组符号
But there are similar symbol sets on Praetorian.

258
00:14:13,253 --> 00:14:14,621
我们那里找到了几块石板
Where we found tablets...

259
00:14:14,687 --> 00:14:16,823
克里斯汀发现上面的文字和
That Christine matched with ancient texts here

260
00:14:16,890 --> 00:14:17,958
瓦迪亚九星的古文相符
on Vadia Nine.

261
00:14:18,058 --> 00:14:19,859
我们认为玛克戎人是
We think the M'Kroon are

262
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:22,795
某个先进文明的直属后裔
the direct descendants of an advanced civilization

263
00:14:22,795 --> 00:14:25,560
而该文明能够在多个星系间旅行
that could travel across multiple galaxies.

264
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,560
远古宇航员吗
Ancient astronauts?

265
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,520
不得而知
We don't know,

266
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:30,670
但是他们自称已经获得了永生
but they claim to have achieved immortality.

267
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:33,240
老生常谈的谬论
A common myth.

268
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,080
众多文明都共有的一类幻想
A fantasy many cultures share.

269
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:38,960
但我们的研究显示 这个文明
But in this case our research suggests that 

270
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,347
实现永生的秘密
their secret to immortality...

271
00:14:40,413 --> 00:14:43,800
有可能涉及到在分子层面上
Had something to do with creating quantum instability

272
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,967
制造量子不稳定现象
at a molecular level.

273
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,120
有意思
Fascinating.

274
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,280
是吧
Right?

275
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:51,720
总之 我交叉对比了这些字符
Okay, so I cross-referenced the symbols

276
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,994
以普莱托利安语和玛克戎古文为参考
with Praetorian and ancient M'Kroonian.

277
00:14:53,994 --> 00:14:58,498
「救赎之道 就在自愿血祭之中」
"The path to absolution, only with blood given freely."

278
00:14:58,565 --> 00:15:00,400
自愿血祭
Blood given freely?

279
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:04,080
一种祭祀礼仪 给神明的献礼
A ritual sacrifice. An offering to the gods.

280
00:15:04,737 --> 00:15:05,820
血祭魔法
Blood magic.

281
00:15:06,660 --> 00:15:09,660
在玛克戎上 我们的祖先会自我献祭
On M'Kroon, our ancestors would sacrifice

282
00:15:09,660 --> 00:15:11,945
以来到时间众神的面前
to stand before the deities of time.

283
00:15:17,450 --> 00:15:18,585
喔 等等
Whoa, hold on.

284
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,187
等一下
Just take a moment

285
00:15:20,187 --> 00:15:22,289
先别急着干这么戏剧化的事情
before we choose the dramatic option.

286
00:15:38,138 --> 00:15:39,306
别
Don't.

287
00:15:58,925 --> 00:16:00,727
认真的吗
Really?

288
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,529
它奏效了
It worked.

289
00:16:06,466 --> 00:16:08,501
你的血里没有检测到外来成分
Nothing foreign detected in your bloodstream.

290
00:16:08,635 --> 00:16:10,470
疼吗 有没有什么症状
Any pain, symptoms of any kind?

291
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:12,305
我没事 少尉
I'll live, Ensign.

292
00:16:13,173 --> 00:16:15,308
好吧 查普尔 这是你的主场了
Well, Chapel, this is your party.

293
00:16:15,408 --> 00:16:17,477
我猜你会想和我一起走
I'm guessing you want to come with me on point.

294
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,466
小心脚下 别碰任何东西
Watch your footing and try not to touch anything.

295
00:16:39,532 --> 00:16:42,235
不幸的是 我来这里就是为了碰东西的 中尉
Sadly, that would defeat my entire purpose here, Lieutenant.

296
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:45,283
好吧 你知道我什么意思的
Well, you know what I mean.

297
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:52,300
和星舰的联系断了
Comms on the ship are down.

298
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:55,682
也就是我们得去外面跟他们汇报
Which means we'd have to go outside to report back.

299
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,900
更重要的是
More importantly...

300
00:16:57,900 --> 00:17:00,887
神庙内不能用传送器
We cannot transport from inside this chamber.

301
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,020
情况很不理想
Far from ideal.

302
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,240
这儿开了
It's open here.

303
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:10,029
有什么光学障碍在那边
Some kind of light barrier.

304
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:13,031
行吧 不管这是什么 我不喜欢它
Yeah, whatever it is, I don't like it.

305
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:16,570
害怕夜魔了吗
Scared of El Cucuy?

306
00:17:17,204 --> 00:17:19,172
我又不是五岁小孩 而且这也不是睡觉时间
I'm not five, and it's not my bedtime.

307
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,511
那是什么 一个巨大的
Hey, what's that, an oversized...?

308
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:27,840
袋子 我本来要说 袋子
Bag. I was gonna say bag,

309
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:29,755
但这是尸体
but, nope, it's a body.

310
00:17:40,993 --> 00:17:43,530
好吧 他们不是永生的
Well, they're not immortal.

311
00:17:43,596 --> 00:17:46,833
读数显示这些残躯已经有几百个年头了
The readings indicate these remains are centuries old.

312
00:17:46,933 --> 00:17:48,401
死因应该是饥饿
Cause of death appears to be starvation.

313
00:17:48,501 --> 00:17:50,069
他们被困在这儿了
They were trapped down here.

314
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:52,605
只是一种直觉 但是我寻思
Just a hunch, but it looks to me

315
00:17:52,739 --> 00:17:54,574
他们应该是来盗墓的
like they were trying to rob the place.

316
00:17:54,674 --> 00:17:57,577
这么看来 这次任务的风险更高了
This discovery raises the threat level of the mission.

317
00:17:57,710 --> 00:17:59,379
我们必须离开 向舰长汇报
We must exit, report this to the captain,

318
00:17:59,446 --> 00:18:00,547
重新评估这次调查的可行性
and reassess our investigation.

319
00:18:00,613 --> 00:18:02,160
等一下
Hold on a second.

320
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,840
不是克莉丝汀在主管这次任务吗
Isn't Christine in charge of this mission?

321
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:06,980
其实 史波克是高级科学官
Actually, Spock is the senior science officer.

322
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,355
但我不用听星际舰队的 不是吗
Well, I don't answer to Starfleet, now, do I?

323
00:18:08,421 --> 00:18:11,791
听着 这种风险忽然变大
Look... this is not the first time

324
00:18:11,891 --> 00:18:14,494
但还不构成致命威胁的情况
that a landing party mission has faced

325
00:18:14,494 --> 00:18:17,540
外勤队已经不是第一次见了
escalated but not lethal danger.

326
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:19,031
星际舰队的规章明确规定了
Starfleet protocol clearly states

327
00:18:19,098 --> 00:18:20,667
外勤队必须警告星舰
a landing party must alert the ship

328
00:18:20,767 --> 00:18:22,235
告知一切明确存在的威胁
to any clear and present danger.

329
00:18:22,335 --> 00:18:24,036
-但什么危险的事都还没发生呢 -史波克
-But nothing dangerous has happened. -Spock,

330
00:18:24,103 --> 00:18:26,606
我们在这里的发现实在是太重要了
wh-what we can discover here is important.

331
00:18:26,739 --> 00:18:29,276
不只是对我 也不只是对罗杰
Not just to me, not just to Roger.

332
00:18:29,376 --> 00:18:31,043
甚至不只是对于科学而言
Not even just to science.

333
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:33,045
奈杰尔 玛克戎人
N'Jal, the M'Kroons,

334
00:18:33,146 --> 00:18:35,081
这是他们的历史
this is their history.

335
00:18:38,618 --> 00:18:41,288
就像你说的 这不只和我们有关
As you've stated, this is not just about us.

336
00:18:42,189 --> 00:18:45,057
奈杰尔 在这里 我们是你的客人
N'Jal, we are your guests here.

337
00:18:45,158 --> 00:18:47,594
你希望我们撤退还是继续调查
Would you prefer if we cease or proceed?

338
00:18:56,803 --> 00:18:58,905
最贴切的翻译是
Closest translation:

339
00:18:58,971 --> 00:19:02,409
「我的人民一直殷切地希望」
"My people have a deep desire.

340
00:19:02,509 --> 00:19:04,811
「能知道我们民族的内核」
We wish to know the core of our being."

341
00:19:09,249 --> 00:19:11,484
信任是双向的 史波克
Trust is a two-way street, Spock.

342
00:19:16,423 --> 00:19:18,191
我们将继续执行任务
We will continue with the mission.

343
00:19:24,997 --> 00:19:26,733
我帮你
I got you.

344
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:32,860
罗杰
Roger.

345
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:45,051
这是一块忆石
It's a memory stone.

346
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:48,221
和我们在普莱托利安上找到的一样
It's just like the ones we found on Praetorian.

347
00:19:48,321 --> 00:19:49,622
克莉丝汀 这个
Christine, this...

348
00:19:49,689 --> 00:19:53,025
这正是我们来这里要找的东西
this is exactly what we came here to find.

349
00:19:55,580 --> 00:19:57,230
小心点
Careful.

350
00:20:06,706 --> 00:20:08,241
甘贝尔
Gamble!

351
00:20:08,375 --> 00:20:10,843
甘贝尔 甘贝尔 你没事吧
Gamble, Gamble, Gamble, Gamble, you okay?

352
00:20:24,357 --> 00:20:27,427
放松 放轻松 你会没事的
Easy, easy. I've got you.

353
00:20:45,378 --> 00:20:47,580
我们刚把碎片送去佩利亚那里分析了
We just sent the fragments to Pelia for analysis.

354
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:49,816
他一捡起这个球体 它就被激活了
The orb triggered when he picked it up.

355
00:20:49,916 --> 00:20:51,250
让小队其他人集合
Gather the rest of the team

356
00:20:51,351 --> 00:20:52,980
然后马上传送回舰
and beam back aboard immediately.

357
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:55,722
收到 舰长
Understood, Captain.

358
00:21:02,595 --> 00:21:03,530
甘贝尔怎么样了
How's Gamble?

359
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:04,731
状态稳定下来了
He's stable.

360
00:21:04,831 --> 00:21:05,932
姆'本加正在
M'Benga's already working on

361
00:21:06,032 --> 00:21:07,266
给他设计一对新的眼睛
bioengineering him new eyes.

362
00:21:07,367 --> 00:21:08,701
我们找到了一些东西
We found something.

363
00:21:08,801 --> 00:21:10,917
我想这是什么登记表吧
I think this is some kind of register.

364
00:21:10,917 --> 00:21:12,580
这里有几千个名字
There are thousands of names here.

365
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:15,908
其中的一些也被写在了那些尸体附近的古物上
Some of which are actually on the artifact you found among the dead.

366
00:21:18,220 --> 00:21:20,053
大伙们 在这里我们是可以学到很多东西
Guys, this is great, and there's so much to learn here,

367
00:21:20,053 --> 00:21:21,320
但我们该走了
but it's time to go.

368
00:21:21,320 --> 00:21:22,615
我们该回舰了
We got to get back to the ship.

369
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:25,418
奈杰尔和我 我们两个要留下
N'Jal and I are, are gonna stay behind.

370
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:28,254
像这样的发现 我等了一辈子
Waited my whole life for a find like this.

371
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,056
罗杰
Roger.

372
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,960
嘿
Hey.

373
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,921
看看这个
Look at this.

374
00:21:32,921 --> 00:21:33,660
这是什么
What is it?

375
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:35,127
我让一个摄像头穿过走廊去看看了
I sent a camera through the doorway.

376
00:21:35,580 --> 00:21:37,497
什么时候干的 我们已经要离开了
Before or after we said to pull out?

377
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:42,340
这是隔壁房间吗
That's the next chamber?

378
00:21:45,800 --> 00:21:46,973
呃
Um...

379
00:21:46,973 --> 00:21:47,960
他说的什么意思
What's he saying?

380
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,900
「危险」
"Danger."

381
00:21:51,040 --> 00:21:52,579
不是「危险」
Not "danger."

382
00:21:53,180 --> 00:21:54,040
是「恶魔」
"Evil."

383
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:54,920
奈杰尔 发生什么了
N'Jal, what's wrong?

384
00:21:56,340 --> 00:21:58,217
我们都死定了
We're all gonna die.

385
00:21:58,217 --> 00:22:00,620
奈杰尔 奈杰尔
N'Jal. N'Jal!

386
00:22:14,680 --> 00:22:16,049
门关了
The door.

387
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:26,946
你好 有人在吗
Hello? Who's here?

388
00:22:27,013 --> 00:22:28,915
为什么这么黑
Why is it dark?

389
00:22:28,981 --> 00:22:30,216
尽量先不要坐起来
Try not to sit up.

390
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,400
是戴着这个我才看不见吗
Is this why I can't see?

391
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,220
不
No.

392
00:22:34,220 --> 00:22:37,640
你的眼球被从眼眶里拽出来了
Your bulbus oculi were ejected from their orbital sockets.

393
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,920
我眼睛没了?
I lost my eyes?

394
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,460
这个仪器本应该帮你再生出一对眼睛来
This should be regenerating them.

395
00:22:40,460 --> 00:22:43,460
但现在 它只能防止伤口进一步的恶化
But right now it's just keeping them from deteriorating further.

396
00:22:43,460 --> 00:22:44,640
我是什么时候受伤的
When was I injured?

397
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:49,160
你在那颗星球上被某种手雷击伤了
You were injured on the planet by a grenade of some type.

398
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:51,203
我们还在分析手雷碎片
We're still analyzing the fragments.

399
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:53,200
外勤队呢 他们还好吗
The landing party? Are they okay?

400
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:54,340
其他人没有受伤
The others are fine.

401
00:22:54,340 --> 00:22:55,842
他们很快就会传送回来
They should be back here any minute.

402
00:22:56,581 --> 00:22:58,411
我的短期记忆受损了
My short-term memory was damaged.

403
00:22:58,411 --> 00:22:59,946
希望不是永久的
Hopefully, it's not permanent.

404
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:02,515
这是创伤后的应激反应
A post-traumatic stress response.

405
00:23:03,300 --> 00:23:04,340
他状态怎么样
Status?

406
00:23:04,340 --> 00:23:06,280
意识清醒 很警惕
Conscious. Alert.

407
00:23:06,280 --> 00:23:08,700
而且很害怕 但很庆幸活下来了
And scared but happy to be alive.

408
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:11,290
理解 情有可原
Well, that's understandable.

409
00:23:13,340 --> 00:23:16,663
休息一会吧 我马上就回来
Rest. I'll be right back.

410
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,040
好吧 给我完整的报告
All right, what's the full report?

411
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,640
我要更改我最初的诊断
I've shifted my initial assessment

412
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:22,820
这不是简单的闪光灼伤
from flash burn

413
00:23:22,820 --> 00:23:24,400
而是某种智能体造成的
to some kind of agent.

414
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,260
生物武器吗
Biological weapon?

415
00:23:26,260 --> 00:23:27,600
有可能
Maybe.

416
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:29,780
没有传染性 以防你要问
And before you ask, he's not contagious.

417
00:23:29,780 --> 00:23:32,700
但有什么东西在阻止他的眼睛再生
But something is preventing his eyes from regenerating.

418
00:23:33,646 --> 00:23:35,414
那你还好吗
Okay, how are you holding up?

419
00:23:35,414 --> 00:23:36,600
我还好
I'm fine.

420
00:23:37,780 --> 00:23:40,660
你知道 甘贝尔原本是来替班查普尔的
You know, when Gamble came on to replace Chapel,

421
00:23:40,660 --> 00:23:42,755
本来是暂时性的顶替 但她回来之后
it was supposed to be temporary, but she came back.

422
00:23:42,755 --> 00:23:44,080
而他留在这里了
And he stayed.

423
00:23:45,480 --> 00:23:47,627
大家都看得出来我很喜欢那个孩子
It's no secret I'm fond of the boy.

424
00:23:49,300 --> 00:23:51,397
他还没准备好出外勤任务
He wasn't ready for away missions.

425
00:23:51,397 --> 00:23:52,960
约瑟夫 你比谁都清楚
Joseph, you know more than most,

426
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,060
我们不可能保护好所有人
we can't protect everyone.

427
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:58,771
但能救治他的人非你莫属
But if anyone's going to help him, it's going to be you.

428
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:25,360
怎么偏偏现在锁上了
It's locked. Why now?

429
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:27,560
这个建筑肯定启动了安全协议
The structure must have engaged a safety protocol.

430
00:24:28,940 --> 00:24:30,080
克莉丝汀 你和拉安带着甘布尔出去的时候
Christine, it didn't trigger

431
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:31,220
这个机关还没有被触发
when you and La'An took Gamble through.

432
00:24:31,900 --> 00:24:33,005
你们回来时也没有
Or when you came back.

433
00:24:33,806 --> 00:24:35,975
你开门的时候 它提取了你的DNA样本
When you unlocked the door, it took a sample of your DNA.

434
00:24:36,075 --> 00:24:37,276
你被扫描了
You were scanned.

435
00:24:37,343 --> 00:24:39,278
当时我们是一起进来的
And we all entered together as a group.

436
00:24:39,378 --> 00:24:40,980
你的生物特征保护了大家
Your biosignature kept us safe.

437
00:24:41,080 --> 00:24:44,817
然后 奈杰尔想单独离开
So, N'Jal tried to leave without me.

438
00:24:46,953 --> 00:24:50,122
好吧 这扇门以前还肯认我 现在彻底不认了
Well, if the door liked me then, it's done liking me now.

439
00:24:50,222 --> 00:24:52,124
不 不 肯定有别的出路
No, no, there has to be another way out.

440
00:24:52,224 --> 00:24:54,493
我们都知道 光靠等下去只有死路一条
We know what happens if we try to wait things out.

441
00:24:55,460 --> 00:24:57,680
你是说要继续往建筑深处走？
You are suggesting we go deeper into the structure?

442
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:59,680
留在这里只会饿死
We stay here and we starve.

443
00:25:00,220 --> 00:25:02,468
无论如何都有风险
Either way is a risk.

444
00:25:02,468 --> 00:25:04,804
我倾向于更主动的选择
I prefer the one that keeps us active.

445
00:25:04,871 --> 00:25:06,338
可以吗
May I?

446
00:25:06,472 --> 00:25:07,439
嗯
Yeah.

447
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,475
拉安
La'An.

448
00:25:12,260 --> 00:25:15,247
贝托的摄像头还在传回另一间房的画面
Beto's camera's still showing the feed from the other chamber.

449
00:25:15,347 --> 00:25:19,552
看起来还算安全
It looks safe, relatively.

450
00:25:22,820 --> 00:25:25,523
所以那个房间就在这扇门后面吗
So that chamber is on the other side of this door?

451
00:25:25,860 --> 00:25:26,940
是的
Yes.

452
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:32,865
好吧 试试看
Okay, let's try it.

453
00:25:32,865 --> 00:25:34,734
查普尔
Chapel?

454
00:25:34,834 --> 00:25:37,069
说不定这扇门还认你呢
Maybe this door still likes you.

455
00:26:04,196 --> 00:26:05,632
好了
Okay.

456
00:26:06,966 --> 00:26:08,534
成功了
That worked.

457
00:26:08,601 --> 00:26:11,003
为防万一 我们应该保持之前的队形
As a precaution, we should use the same formation as before.

458
00:26:11,103 --> 00:26:12,404
好
Yeah.

459
00:26:12,504 --> 00:26:14,941
以防我们被强光烧成灰吗
Precaution against being incinerated by burning light?

460
00:26:15,041 --> 00:26:17,243
查普尔跟我 乌乎拉跟贝托
Chapel with me. Uhura, Beto.

461
00:26:17,343 --> 00:26:19,578
史波克和科尔比 你们殿后
Spock and Korby, you take up the rear.

462
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:47,206
看啊
Look at it.

463
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:49,169
罗杰 这
Roger, this...

464
00:26:52,311 --> 00:26:54,146
他们不见了
They're gone.

465
00:27:02,989 --> 00:27:06,558
等等 我们先想想
Wait. Let's think about this.

466
00:27:06,659 --> 00:27:09,261
-再过去恐怕我们也要走散 -是的
-We could get separated, too. -Yeah.

467
00:27:09,361 --> 00:27:10,963
通讯呢
Huh, what about comms?

468
00:27:11,520 --> 00:27:13,400
我知道我们联系不上星舰 但是
I know we can't reach the ship, but...

469
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:14,200
也许
Maybe,

470
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:17,603
也许干扰是来自建筑本身的
maybe the interference is coming from the building itself.

471
00:27:21,360 --> 00:27:24,010
拉安呼叫史波克 收到请回答
La'An to Spock, do you read me?

472
00:27:27,153 --> 00:27:28,620
史波克收到
Spock here, I read you.

473
00:27:28,620 --> 00:27:31,718
科尔比博士和我在一个单独的房间里
Dr. Korby and I appear to be in a room by ourselves.

474
00:27:32,310 --> 00:27:35,112
我们也收到了 是我和贝托
We copy, too. It's Beto and I.

475
00:27:35,112 --> 00:27:36,580
虽然还在一起
Also alone.

476
00:27:36,580 --> 00:27:40,159
但也就只有我们了
Together but alone.

477
00:27:40,259 --> 00:27:41,627
我们还有通讯
We have comms.

478
00:27:41,694 --> 00:27:43,629
勉强算是个好消息吧
I'd call that a silver lining.

479
00:27:44,500 --> 00:27:45,460
好吧
Okay.

480
00:27:45,460 --> 00:27:46,820
都待在原地别动
Stay put wherever you are.

481
00:27:46,820 --> 00:27:48,100
没意见
No arguments here.

482
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,869
同意
Agreed.

483
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:56,475
你们的房间正中间有个大雕像吗
Do you guys have a giant statue in the middle of your chamber?

484
00:27:57,060 --> 00:27:59,111
我们的房间和刚离开的那个一模一样
Our room looks just like the one we left.

485
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:01,413
连盗墓贼的尸体都在
Dead grave robbers and all.

486
00:28:01,513 --> 00:28:04,160
或许我们应该勘察一下各自的区域
Perhaps we should surveil our respective areas

487
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:05,320
然后再汇报
and report back.

488
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:06,480
好
All right.

489
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:08,220
我们十分钟后再重新联络
Let's reconvene on comms in ten minutes.

490
00:28:08,320 --> 00:28:09,840
保持警惕
And stay alert.

491
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:18,497
暂无定论
Inconclusive.

492
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,820
好痒
That tickles.

493
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:43,648
你醒了
You're awake.

494
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:46,900
这个根本没用 是吧
This isn't doing anything, is it?

495
00:28:48,127 --> 00:28:49,962
是的 没用
No, it's not.

496
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:52,600
我到底怎么了 约瑟夫
What's happening to me, Joseph?

497
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:56,520
你叫我的名字了
You used my first name.

498
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:59,660
抱歉 姆本加医生
I'm sorry. Dr. M'Benga.

499
00:28:59,660 --> 00:29:01,440
-你说得对 -没事 挺好的
-You're right, I... -No, it's good.

500
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:03,960
你早该在我面前别那么拘谨了
It's more than time you feel comfortable around me.

501
00:29:04,747 --> 00:29:06,220
看来死里逃生
I guess a close call like that

502
00:29:06,220 --> 00:29:07,900
真的能让人想通一些事
can really put some things in perspective.

503
00:29:09,860 --> 00:29:11,884
这个读数
This reading...

504
00:29:11,884 --> 00:29:13,252
等一下
Hold on.

505
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:26,543
好了 我们再试一次
All right, let's try this again.

506
00:29:34,173 --> 00:29:35,207
怎么了
What?

507
00:29:35,207 --> 00:29:36,900
是什么 读数怎么说
What is it? What does it say?

508
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:40,180
我们需要更多测试
We need more tests.

509
00:29:40,180 --> 00:29:41,480
医生
Doctor...

510
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:43,482
约瑟夫 你就告诉我吧
Joseph, just tell me.

511
00:29:44,280 --> 00:29:46,300
我只能直说了
There's no other way to put this,

512
00:29:47,541 --> 00:29:48,888
你的大脑已经死了
your brain is dead.

513
00:29:48,888 --> 00:29:52,200
扫描显示整个脑叶 所有的电子 神经元
The scan shows entire lobes, electrons, neurons,

514
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,680
全都停止活动了
all shut down.

515
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:56,380
不可能 那我怎么还活着
No. That's impossible. How am I alive?

516
00:29:56,380 --> 00:29:57,680
我还醒着 还能说话
I-I'm awake, we're talking.

517
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:59,465
是的 我知道 正如我所说
Yes, I know. Exactly like I said.

518
00:29:59,465 --> 00:30:00,800
我们需要更多测试
We need more tests.

519
00:30:00,800 --> 00:30:02,040
我还没死
I'm not dead!

520
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:04,280
-嘿 深呼吸 我没说你死了 -不 但是
-Hey, take a breath, I didn't say that. -No, but, but,

521
00:30:05,580 --> 00:30:07,100
我要给你打一针镇定剂 放松
I'm giving you a sedative. Relax.

522
00:30:07,100 --> 00:30:08,340
但是
But--

523
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:09,900
冷静下来
Stay calm.

524
00:30:11,740 --> 00:30:13,880
我会弄明白的
I'll figure this out.

525
00:30:17,940 --> 00:30:19,340
-查普尔 -嗯?
-Chapel. -Hmm?

526
00:30:19,340 --> 00:30:22,154
为什么这个考古遗址里会出现地球语言
Why is there an Earth language at your ancient dig site?

527
00:30:22,745 --> 00:30:24,380
是中文
It's Chinese.

528
00:30:24,380 --> 00:30:28,861
「永恒之桥的守望者矗立于此」
"Here stands the Beholder, sentry of eternal bridges."

529
00:30:31,180 --> 00:30:33,065
居然有生物信号
A biosignature?

530
00:30:35,580 --> 00:30:38,280
这东西有生命迹象
This thing has a life sign reading.

531
00:30:42,380 --> 00:30:43,580
看着没那么有生气啊
Doesn't act very alive.

532
00:30:43,580 --> 00:30:46,080
哦 严格来说这东西既是活的也是死的
Oh, well, technically, it's both alive and not.

533
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,680
而且 它不是真的在这里
Also, it's not really here.

534
00:30:49,320 --> 00:30:52,051
嗯 反正我正在看着它 所以
Hmm, well, I'm looking right at it, so...

535
00:30:53,120 --> 00:30:55,260
在量子水平上 组成这个守望者的粒子
On a quantum level, the-the particles that make up

536
00:30:55,260 --> 00:30:59,091
是不断变化的
this Beholder are in constant flux.

537
00:30:59,091 --> 00:31:01,740
既在这里也不在这里
Both here and not here.

538
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:07,466
分子水平上的量子不稳定性
Quantum instability at a molecular level.

539
00:31:09,501 --> 00:31:10,860
真好
Great.

540
00:31:12,058 --> 00:31:13,860
所以这是什么意思
So what does that mean?

541
00:31:13,860 --> 00:31:15,120
完全不知道呢
Not a clue.

542
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,800
那很好了
Brilliant.

543
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:23,980
这真的是我们之前来过的同一个房间吗
Is this really the same room we were just in?

544
00:31:24,780 --> 00:31:27,253
也许是 但你看
Perhaps, but look.

545
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:33,425
鉴于奈杰尔的下场 我可不会去那里
I wouldn't go that way after what happened to N'Jal.

546
00:31:36,370 --> 00:31:38,200
你真的觉得那只是个幻想吗
Do you really think it's a fantasy?

547
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:41,667
你反对永生这个想法吗
You balk at the idea of immortality?

548
00:31:43,203 --> 00:31:44,604
你难道觉得世上不存在科学的手段
You don't think that the science exists

549
00:31:44,604 --> 00:31:46,772
来防止我们的意识消散吗
to prevent our consciousness from fading?

550
00:31:46,772 --> 00:31:49,141
我不反对你的想法 科尔比博士
I do not balk at your ideas, Dr. Korby.

551
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:52,040
我只是认为你疏于做适当的预防措施
I merely believe you neglect to take the proper precautions.

552
00:31:53,112 --> 00:31:54,546
什么？
Huh?

553
00:31:55,120 --> 00:31:56,700
我是说你疏于做适当的
I said you neglect to take the proper...

554
00:31:56,700 --> 00:31:58,240
不 看这里
No, no, no, no, look here.

555
00:32:00,180 --> 00:32:02,720
在名字上面 这个词 意思是
Above the names, this-this word, it means, um,

556
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,400
寄生虫 或者搭便车的人
parasites or hitchhikers.

557
00:32:04,740 --> 00:32:07,826
还有这个词 意思是井或者是坑
And-and this word, it means well or pit.

558
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,928
这个词 Vezda
This word... Vezda.

559
00:32:09,996 --> 00:32:12,965
Vezda 玛克戎语中的「邪恶」一词吗
Vezda. The M'Kroon word for evil?

560
00:32:13,900 --> 00:32:14,500
是
Yes.

561
00:32:14,500 --> 00:32:18,270
这个词只在这里用过 而且
Only here it's used, Vezda, it-it...

562
00:32:18,270 --> 00:32:20,106
是复数
it isn't singular.

563
00:32:37,256 --> 00:32:38,424
真有意思
Fascinating.

564
00:32:38,524 --> 00:32:39,992
怎么了
What is it?

565
00:32:50,269 --> 00:32:51,703
你看到什么了
What do you see?

566
00:32:51,803 --> 00:32:54,406
这些东西有成千上万个
Thousands of them.

567
00:33:24,203 --> 00:33:26,140
我们的外勤队还没回来
Our landing party never came back.

568
00:33:26,140 --> 00:33:27,839
我弟弟本不该遇到这种事
My brother didn't sign up for this.

569
00:33:28,620 --> 00:33:30,700
所有参与项目的玛克戎联络人
All of the M'Kroon liaisons on the project have

570
00:33:30,700 --> 00:33:32,711
突然进入了无线电静默状态
suddenly gone radio silent.

571
00:33:32,811 --> 00:33:34,180
当地人把我们的联系切断了
The locals have cut us off.

572
00:33:34,180 --> 00:33:35,714
那就再派出一个外勤队
So send down another landing party.

573
00:33:35,814 --> 00:33:38,417
对啊 他们不能阻止我们把我们的人救回来
Aye. They cannot keep us from getting our people back.

574
00:33:38,550 --> 00:33:39,718
不幸的是 他们可以
Unfortunately, they can.

575
00:33:39,818 --> 00:33:41,353
我们签过了特别通行协议
We're here with a special access agreement.

576
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:43,500
我能向他们求助
I can reach out,

577
00:33:43,500 --> 00:33:45,940
如果大使帮不上忙 我们就自己下去
if the ambassador is no help, we will go down there.

578
00:33:45,940 --> 00:33:47,959
关于我们遇到的这个爆炸装置
What do we know about the explosive device

579
00:33:47,959 --> 00:33:48,880
我们都知道些什么
that we encountered?

580
00:33:49,361 --> 00:33:50,462
从技术上来说
Technically it's a...

581
00:33:50,462 --> 00:33:53,932
这个东西是个收容单元
It's a, it's a containment unit.

582
00:33:54,340 --> 00:33:56,960
就其本身而言 球体不应该发生爆炸
On its own, the orb should not have exploded.

583
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:59,780
可能是由于它离开了能量源
It's possible it got separated from its power source 

584
00:33:59,780 --> 00:34:00,839
然后变弱了
and weakened.

585
00:34:00,939 --> 00:34:02,508
但我们估计 最可能是因为
But best we can figure is

586
00:34:02,574 --> 00:34:05,077
里面的能量源强行冲了出来
that the energy source inside of it forced its way out.

587
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:07,380
怎么个强行冲出来
Forced its way out, how?

588
00:34:07,840 --> 00:34:09,480
它会不会有自己的意识
Could it have been sentient?

589
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:11,250
我们无从得知
Oh, we don't know.

590
00:34:13,620 --> 00:34:16,255
佩利亚 你还有什么没告诉我们
Pelia, what aren't you telling us?

591
00:34:16,355 --> 00:34:19,056
这个东西
This thing...

592
00:34:19,125 --> 00:34:22,393
比我见过的所有东西都要古老
is older than anything I've ever seen.

593
00:34:23,529 --> 00:34:25,831
你觉得里面是什么
What do you think was inside of it?

594
00:34:26,965 --> 00:34:28,434
我不确定
I'm not sure.

595
00:34:29,540 --> 00:34:34,072
而且我完全没法科学地解释这一切
And I have no scientific way of putting this,

596
00:34:34,072 --> 00:34:36,875
但不管这东西是什么
but whatever it is,

597
00:34:36,975 --> 00:34:40,812
都让我不寒而栗
it gives me the heebie-jeebies.

598
00:34:45,917 --> 00:34:47,320
甘布尔少尉
Ensign Gamble.

599
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:49,640
舰长呼叫安全部 到医务室与我会合
Captain to Security. Meet me in sickbay.

600
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:07,500
露吉雅 多么好听的名字
Rukiya, what a beautiful name.

601
00:35:08,020 --> 00:35:10,309
真可惜你不得不放手
It's a shame you had to let her go.

602
00:35:16,148 --> 00:35:19,251
我没跟你说过露吉雅的事
I never told you about Rukiya.

603
00:35:21,453 --> 00:35:24,156
嗯 是啊
Hmm, you're right.

604
00:35:25,791 --> 00:35:27,092
说漏嘴了
My mistake.

605
00:35:27,859 --> 00:35:29,628
你真以为去找你的那个女人
Do you think that woman who came to you

606
00:35:29,728 --> 00:35:31,430
的确是你女儿吗
was really your daughter?

607
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:35,520
还是说你觉得有什么东西伪装成了她的模样
Or do you think it was something wearing her skin?

608
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:40,306
夺走她的泪水 吞噬她的哭喊声的某种存在
Something that drank her tears and fed off her screams?

609
00:35:42,460 --> 00:35:45,195
跟我说话的是谁
Who am I talking to right now?

610
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:48,000
什么鬼
What the hell?

611
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:49,180
发生什么了
What was that?

612
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:52,160
外来的某种智慧生命
A foreign intelligence.

613
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,539
在我体内吗
Inside me?

614
00:35:53,539 --> 00:35:55,040
它怎么能说话的 它在用我来说话
How was it talking? It had my voice.

615
00:35:55,040 --> 00:35:56,555
我还不知道
I don't know yet.

616
00:35:57,620 --> 00:35:59,191
为什么它要说这些东西
Why would it say those things?

617
00:35:59,191 --> 00:36:01,800
放松 深呼吸
Relax. Take a breath.

618
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:02,989
约瑟夫
Joseph...

619
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:06,432
我有些不舒服 像偏头痛一样
I'm having a reaction, feels like a migraine.

620
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:11,380
是你
You.

621
00:36:11,380 --> 00:36:13,171
囚禁者
Cali-katchna!

622
00:36:14,020 --> 00:36:15,574
邪恶之物
Mika-tah, Vezda-pah!

623
00:36:15,674 --> 00:36:16,440
舰长
Captain...

624
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:53,412
玛丽
Marie!

625
00:36:59,285 --> 00:37:00,419
玛丽
Marie.

626
00:37:02,388 --> 00:37:04,089
玛丽 是我
Marie, it's me...

627
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:23,380
别逼我这样做
I don't want to have to do this,

628
00:37:23,380 --> 00:37:24,860
所有人都给我退开
everybody just leave me alone.

629
00:37:24,860 --> 00:37:26,500
冷静
Easy, easy.

630
00:37:27,380 --> 00:37:28,440
甘布尔 是我
Gamble, it's me.

631
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:30,380
姆'本加医生
Dr. M'Benga?

632
00:37:32,083 --> 00:37:34,185
我本不想这样做的
I didn't mean to do that.

633
00:37:38,890 --> 00:37:40,420
我相信你
I believe you.

634
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,600
求你了 把相位枪放下
Please, put the phaser down.

635
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:45,397
为什么所有人都想伤害我
Why is everybody trying to hurt me?

636
00:37:45,397 --> 00:37:49,167
他们不是想伤害你 我们是想帮你
They are not, we're trying to help you.

637
00:37:49,460 --> 00:37:50,520
放下武器
Stand down.

638
00:37:50,520 --> 00:37:51,770
给他一些空间
Give him room.

639
00:37:54,673 --> 00:37:57,460
如果我让他们带走我 你会治好我吗
If I let them take me, will you fix me?

640
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:59,540
我只想重新变回我自己
I just want to be me again.

641
00:37:59,540 --> 00:38:02,948
我会的 不用担心
I've got you, don't worry.

642
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:11,600
医务室还是禁闭室 长官
Sickbay or the brig, sir?

643
00:38:18,129 --> 00:38:19,565
扫描显示
Scans are showing

644
00:38:19,565 --> 00:38:21,900
这根柱子在现实空间中时隐时现
this pillar is shifting in and out of this reality.

645
00:38:22,380 --> 00:38:25,060
你意思是 这个诡异的地下洞窟变得更诡异了?
You mean the freaky underground hell hole gets even freakier?

646
00:38:25,904 --> 00:38:28,540
我们就要像那些探险家一样死在这了
We're just going to die here like those explorers we found.

647
00:38:28,540 --> 00:38:29,480
嘿
Hey.

648
00:38:30,409 --> 00:38:31,920
看着我
Look at me.

649
00:38:32,760 --> 00:38:35,013
我经历过你这种情况
I've been where you are right now,

650
00:38:35,540 --> 00:38:36,820
我也知道你现在只能满脑子想着
and I know that all you can focus on

651
00:38:36,820 --> 00:38:38,350
这一切有多么糟糕
is how bad this all feels.

652
00:38:38,350 --> 00:38:40,586
我满脑子都是我们单独被困在这里 还有什么东西
All I can think about is being trapped down here alone with...

653
00:38:40,586 --> 00:38:42,500
我们并不孤单
We're not alone.

654
00:38:43,780 --> 00:38:45,991
我们会找到离开这里的方法
We are going to find our way out of this.

655
00:38:46,892 --> 00:38:47,959
我们一起
Together.

656
00:38:47,959 --> 00:38:50,100
只要深呼吸就好
Just breathe.

657
00:39:01,740 --> 00:39:03,109
多谢
Thank you.

658
00:39:10,940 --> 00:39:12,600
这怎么可能
I'm seeing the impossible.

659
00:39:15,353 --> 00:39:17,020
看
Look.

660
00:39:17,020 --> 00:39:19,440
乌乎拉呼叫外勤队
Uhura to landing party,

661
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:20,740
我想我发现了什么
I think I've got something.

662
00:39:20,740 --> 00:39:22,628
我们也有一些有趣的发现
We have some interesting finds, too.

663
00:39:22,628 --> 00:39:24,530
确实 这里有很多可以讨论的东西
Indeed, there is much to discuss.

664
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:28,440
这个雕像有不稳定的相位差异
The statue in here is giving off unstable phase variances.

665
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:30,402
而且它还有生命信号
And it has a life sign.

666
00:39:30,402 --> 00:39:33,004
科尔比和我发现了一种智慧生命的存在
Korby and I discovered the presence of sentient life.

667
00:39:34,740 --> 00:39:37,909
有趣 我不记得有这个伤口
Curious, I do not recall this injury.

668
00:39:38,811 --> 00:39:41,413
好了 这整件事都很奇幻
Look, all of that is amazing.

669
00:39:41,413 --> 00:39:44,650
这整个地方都是 但是重点是
This whole place is, but the thing is

670
00:39:45,040 --> 00:39:47,318
我们其实在同一个房间
we are all still together.

671
00:39:47,419 --> 00:39:49,921
这怎么可能呢
How is that even possible?

672
00:39:50,856 --> 00:39:52,223
直觉型软件系统
The intuitive software,

673
00:39:52,223 --> 00:39:54,092
它检测到了我们的生物信号而且把我们
it's-it's picking up our biosignatures and placing us

674
00:39:54,092 --> 00:39:55,300
所有人放到了一个房间里
all in the same room.

675
00:39:55,300 --> 00:39:56,560
这是一个多层维度的空间
This is layered dimensional space.

676
00:39:56,560 --> 00:39:58,697
我们不是在不同的房间里
We're not in different rooms.

677
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:01,060
而是在不同的现实位面中
This is different planes of existence.

678
00:40:01,060 --> 00:40:02,480
我们从来都没有离开过第一个房间
We never left the first chamber.

679
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:04,520
如果亚原子不稳定性就是
If subatomic instability was being

680
00:40:04,520 --> 00:40:06,271
他们达成永生的手段 那么
utilized as a means to immortality, then...

681
00:40:06,337 --> 00:40:08,339
那么这个地方可能是个实验室
Then maybe this place is a lab

682
00:40:08,474 --> 00:40:10,842
或者是什么不老泉
or a-a fountain of youth?

683
00:40:11,500 --> 00:40:13,000
这事恐怕不是这么简单
I fear it is not that simple.

684
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:14,880
史波克发现这些球里面困有许多生物
Spock found life-forms trapped inside orbs,

685
00:40:15,411 --> 00:40:17,580
和伤害了甘布尔的那个东西一样
just like the one that injured Gamble.

686
00:40:17,580 --> 00:40:19,685
石板上称呼它们为寄生虫 搭便车的人
The tablet called them parasites. Hitchhikers.

687
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:22,020
不被欢迎的客人
Unwelcome guests.

688
00:40:22,020 --> 00:40:23,480
有可能是因为 通过在不同维度中相移
It is possible phase-shifting through dimensions

689
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,660
来达到永生有副作用
to achieve immortality had a side effect.

690
00:40:25,660 --> 00:40:27,192
或者带来了什么东西
Of bringing something through.

691
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:28,960
到底是什么东西
What kind of something?

692
00:40:29,520 --> 00:40:33,320
一些从其他地方过来的东西
Somethings... from somewhere else.

693
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:35,960
如果这个地方不是什么宫殿或者实验室呢
What if this place isn't a palace or a lab?

694
00:40:36,535 --> 00:40:38,369
它会不会是个监狱
What if it's a prison?

695
00:40:51,583 --> 00:40:55,020
对不起 但是我们必须在这里看着你
I'm sorry, but we'll have to look after you from here.

696
00:40:55,665 --> 00:40:56,900
没关系的
It's okay.

697
00:40:56,900 --> 00:40:58,423
我能理解
I understand.

698
00:41:00,592 --> 00:41:02,628
我之后会怎么样
What's gonna happen to me?

699
00:41:06,364 --> 00:41:08,433
我要是知道就好了
I wish I could say.

700
00:41:17,943 --> 00:41:19,560
这句铭文写的是
This inscription reads

701
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:21,457
「触手可及 但也遥不可及」
"Here and not here."

702
00:41:25,617 --> 00:41:26,720
在普莱托利安上
On Praetorian,

703
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:29,187
有些文物会被放置在这样的底座上
artifacts were sometimes set into pedestals like this.

704
00:41:29,699 --> 00:41:30,900
那些零部件
Component parts.

705
00:41:30,900 --> 00:41:32,080
只要组装起来 也许就会是
Together they might be the key

706
00:41:32,080 --> 00:41:34,225
把维度偏移合并起来的关键
to unifying the dimensional shift.

707
00:41:34,225 --> 00:41:35,240
浮雕在这里
The relief there.

708
00:41:38,597 --> 00:41:40,120
纹章戒指呢
The signet ring.

709
00:41:40,120 --> 00:41:41,123
还在我这儿
I still have it.

710
00:41:41,580 --> 00:41:43,268
好的 但是该怎么样才能
Okay, but how do we get those

711
00:41:43,268 --> 00:41:44,940
让困在不同的位面里的我们
two things to work together

712
00:41:44,940 --> 00:41:46,772
把这两件东西组合起来
whilst stuck on different dimensional planes?

713
00:41:48,073 --> 00:41:50,676
把浮雕放在写着圣龛的地方
Put the tablet where it says tabernacle.

714
00:41:52,911 --> 00:41:54,020
好了
Done.

715
00:41:59,420 --> 00:42:00,788
乌乎拉 戒指
Uhura, the ring.

716
00:42:02,944 --> 00:42:05,480
好 然后呢
Okay. What now?

717
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:08,126
我是这一切的关键 对吧
I'm the key to all of this, right?

718
00:42:27,646 --> 00:42:29,447
克莉丝汀
Christine.

719
00:42:38,156 --> 00:42:40,726
越来越奇怪了
Curiouser and curiouser.

720
00:42:44,660 --> 00:42:48,166
好的 所以现在我们重聚在一起了 但是
Okay, so we're all back together, but...

721
00:42:49,167 --> 00:42:51,269
我们怎么到门口去
...how do we get to the door?

722
00:42:59,510 --> 00:43:00,846
你感觉还好吗
How are you?

723
00:43:02,916 --> 00:43:04,650
这是为了以防我又失控吗
In case I go off the rails again?

724
00:43:04,650 --> 00:43:05,917
嗯
Mm.

725
00:43:06,918 --> 00:43:08,954
姆'本加觉得 在确保没有危险前
M'Benga didn't want to release you to the quarters

726
00:43:09,020 --> 00:43:10,960
还不能放你回舱室 不过
without knowing it was safe, and...

727
00:43:11,980 --> 00:43:13,692
我知道我不需要用这玩意
I knew I wouldn't need it.

728
00:43:13,692 --> 00:43:16,094
克里斯 我不知道当时发生了什么
Chris, I don't know what happened in there.

729
00:43:16,929 --> 00:43:18,500
我体内的什么东西突然就失控了
Something inside of me just snapped.

730
00:43:19,420 --> 00:43:20,766
甘布尔怎么样了
How's Gamble?

731
00:43:20,766 --> 00:43:22,067
被监禁着
In custody.

732
00:43:22,540 --> 00:43:24,160
他也不太正常
He's not quite himself, either.

733
00:43:24,160 --> 00:43:26,772
我记得我看到了他 但是
I remember seeing him, but it...

734
00:43:28,306 --> 00:43:30,208
那不是他
It wasn't him.

735
00:43:31,409 --> 00:43:33,278
那是另一个存在
He was something else.

736
00:43:35,213 --> 00:43:37,148
而且我感觉
And I felt...

737
00:43:38,917 --> 00:43:40,840
我也不像自己了
...like something else.

738
00:43:43,321 --> 00:43:44,823
什么意思
What?

739
00:43:44,890 --> 00:43:46,624
我描述不出来
I can't describe it.

740
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:51,129
我只是遏制不住想杀死
I just had this overwhelming desire to kill...

741
00:43:53,564 --> 00:43:55,834
不对 想抹杀他的冲动
...no, to exterminate him.

742
00:43:58,203 --> 00:44:00,105
至少你现在回来了
Well, you're back now.

743
00:44:01,239 --> 00:44:03,300
其他人对他有过这种反应吗
Has anyone else reacted to him this way?

744
00:44:04,200 --> 00:44:05,720
没有 
No. 

745
00:44:05,720 --> 00:44:09,480
我们得考虑这是你体内的戈恩基因的表现
We have to consider that it's an expression of the Gorn DNA in your body.

746
00:44:10,381 --> 00:44:12,150
我们不知晓那种疗法还有什么副作用
We don't know all the downsides.

747
00:44:13,051 --> 00:44:15,120
这种感受
This feeling I had,

748
00:44:15,253 --> 00:44:16,855
我解释不清楚
I can't explain it,

749
00:44:16,922 --> 00:44:19,958
但是它感觉很 古老
but it felt... old.

750
00:44:23,361 --> 00:44:24,830
好
Okay.

751
00:44:26,880 --> 00:44:28,934
不论如何 我们会把它弄清楚的
Whatever it is, we'll figure it out.

752
00:44:30,680 --> 00:44:31,920
外勤队怎么样了
The landing party?

753
00:44:31,920 --> 00:44:33,160
仍然失联中
Still missing.

754
00:44:33,760 --> 00:44:37,240
舰长 玛克戎大使正在等待跟你通话
Captain, I've got the M'Kroon Ambassador on standby for you.

755
00:44:37,240 --> 00:44:38,543
把他接过来
Patch it through.

756
00:44:39,380 --> 00:44:40,645
好的
Okay.

757
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:44,382
所以 我们得想办法到门口去
So, we got to find a way to get to the door.

758
00:44:53,959 --> 00:44:55,226
原来如此
Of course.

759
00:44:56,600 --> 00:44:58,780
在这个被我们重组了的维度空间里
In this reconstituted dimensional space,

760
00:44:58,780 --> 00:45:01,219
倒置的因果律与常规法则共存
inverted causality coexists.

761
00:45:01,219 --> 00:45:03,735
呃 你最好还是解释清楚点
Uh, yeah, you're gonna have to walk me through that one.

762
00:45:03,735 --> 00:45:05,400
因果律倒置是指在某维度中
Inverted causality is a dimension

763
00:45:05,400 --> 00:45:07,260
结果出现在起因之前的现象
where effects can happen before cause.

764
00:45:07,260 --> 00:45:09,808
呃 这是个悖论
It's, uh... It's paradoxical.

765
00:45:10,280 --> 00:45:12,240
是的 这是个理论假设
Yes, and theoretical,

766
00:45:12,240 --> 00:45:14,140
但在科学上也是成立的
but also scientifically possible.

767
00:45:14,140 --> 00:45:15,440
科尔比博士和我被单独分开的时候
When Dr. Korby and I were separated,

768
00:45:15,440 --> 00:45:16,819
这里有一座桥
there was a bridge here.

769
00:45:16,819 --> 00:45:18,600
而门旁的那个面板亮的是白光
And that panel by the door was glowing white.

770
00:45:18,600 --> 00:45:20,499
现在它亮的是红光
Well, it's red now.

771
00:45:20,499 --> 00:45:22,720
是的 所以我们肯定是把它打开了
Yes. So we must have turned it on.

772
00:45:23,420 --> 00:45:25,190
结果出现在起因之前
Effect before cause?

773
00:45:26,792 --> 00:45:29,828
所以你是说 不不
So you're saying... No, no.

774
00:45:31,863 --> 00:45:33,698
不可能
No.

775
00:45:34,960 --> 00:45:36,600
什么 什么不
What? "No, no" what?

776
00:45:36,600 --> 00:45:37,780
没错
Yes.

777
00:45:37,960 --> 00:45:39,740
我们必须走过那片虚空
We must walk across this empty space

778
00:45:40,560 --> 00:45:41,940
并开启那座桥
and turn on the bridge.

779
00:45:51,950 --> 00:45:54,185
警卫 警卫
Guard. Guard!

780
00:45:54,185 --> 00:45:56,060
你的母亲 她正处于痛苦之中
Your mother. She's in pain.

781
00:45:56,060 --> 00:45:57,956
有什么东西正在伤害她
Something's hurting her.

782
00:45:58,023 --> 00:45:59,390
什么
What?

783
00:46:00,191 --> 00:46:03,094
她的名字 叫雅拉
Her name... it's Jara.

784
00:46:05,400 --> 00:46:07,835
她想告诉你是什么在伤害她
She wants to tell you what's hurting her.

785
00:46:08,140 --> 00:46:09,534
谁告诉你的
Who told you that?

786
00:46:12,537 --> 00:46:16,741
是你伤害了我 你让我独自死去
You did. You let me die alone.

787
00:46:32,240 --> 00:46:34,560
不行 我才不要这么做 没门
Nope, I-I'm not doing that. No way.

788
00:46:34,560 --> 00:46:36,394
我们的另一个选项是留在这里挨饿
Our other option is to remain here and starve.

789
00:46:37,360 --> 00:46:39,120
相当有意思的战术讨论
A sound tactical argument.

790
00:46:39,660 --> 00:46:42,400
好吧 你打头阵 我跟着你
So... you lead, I'll follow.

791
00:46:42,851 --> 00:46:44,019
别踩到我的脚就行
Just don't step on my toes.

792
00:46:44,019 --> 00:46:46,171
我也愿意冒这个险
I am also willing to take this risk.

793
00:46:47,139 --> 00:46:49,941
然而 我确信我们其实必须
However, I believe that we must, in fact,

794
00:46:49,941 --> 00:46:51,843
一起协力完成这件事
commit to doing this all together.

795
00:46:51,843 --> 00:46:53,578
只有查普尔护士能开门
And Nurse Chapel is the key.

796
00:46:55,340 --> 00:46:57,020
别这么做 克莉丝汀
Don't do it, Christine.

797
00:46:57,020 --> 00:47:00,051
理论成立不代表你真的就可以浮空
Theoretical doesn't mean you can just go and walk on air.

798
00:47:00,051 --> 00:47:01,440
查普尔护士
Nurse Chapel,

799
00:47:01,440 --> 00:47:03,859
涉及许多方面的事情 你也许不如以往那般信任我
I may no longer have your confidence on many things,

800
00:47:04,686 --> 00:47:06,257
但这次我们在谈的是科学
but this is a matter of science.

801
00:47:06,257 --> 00:47:09,660
况且这关系到我们的生死存亡
And what hangs in the balance is our survival.

802
00:47:12,700 --> 00:47:14,599
我们当前最需要的就是双向的信任
We are on a two-way street.

803
00:47:15,800 --> 00:47:18,303
现在 我请求你 只要相信我就行
And now I'm asking you to simply trust me.

804
00:47:20,419 --> 00:47:21,987
罗杰 我们该离开了
Roger, it's time to go.

805
00:47:23,308 --> 00:47:24,442
不
No.

806
00:47:24,442 --> 00:47:26,777
克莉丝汀 理智点啊
Christine, listen to reason.

807
00:47:26,777 --> 00:47:29,447
是 走过去是有风险
Yes, it is a risk walking out there,

808
00:47:29,447 --> 00:47:31,600
但是我们相识的这段不长的时间里
but in the short time that I've known you,

809
00:47:31,600 --> 00:47:33,418
你来都没有害怕过冒险
you've never been afraid of taking a chance.

810
00:47:33,859 --> 00:47:35,987
还记得几个月前你对我说过的话吗
Remember what you said to me, all those months ago?

811
00:47:36,560 --> 00:47:38,556
「人生百态 皆无定数」
"Nothing in life is guaranteed."

812
00:47:39,440 --> 00:47:41,492
那就是人生的意义
That's what makes life worth living.

813
00:47:44,095 --> 00:47:45,463
好吧
Okay.

814
00:47:46,360 --> 00:47:48,433
罗杰 别碰那个古物
Roger, leave the relic where it is.

815
00:47:49,219 --> 00:47:51,469
我们能在一起全靠它了
It's the only thing keeping us together.

816
00:48:04,782 --> 00:48:06,184
好了
Okay.

817
00:48:06,952 --> 00:48:09,154
你看见它在这里了对吧
So this is where you saw it?

818
00:48:10,388 --> 00:48:11,822
是的
Yes.

819
00:48:15,026 --> 00:48:16,227
明白
Okay.

820
00:48:25,736 --> 00:48:27,305
那么
Well...

821
00:48:27,305 --> 00:48:29,240
出发吧
let's go.

822
00:48:36,514 --> 00:48:38,749
我们离开这儿
Let's get out of here.

823
00:48:58,739 --> 00:49:01,039
嘿 我们还活着
Hey. We're alive.

824
00:49:01,939 --> 00:49:03,874
这就够了
Take the win.

825
00:49:08,713 --> 00:49:11,249
输入高级军官指令代码
Senior officer command codes, please,

826
00:49:11,349 --> 00:49:12,550
不然我就杀了你
or I will kill you.

827
00:49:12,650 --> 00:49:14,852
什么 你在说什么
What? What are you saying?

828
00:49:14,919 --> 00:49:17,522
我能看到这小子的思想和记忆
I have the boy's thoughts, his memories.

829
00:49:17,622 --> 00:49:20,425
你能从轮机室超控这整艘船
You can take control of this vessel from Engineering.

830
00:49:21,659 --> 00:49:23,161
镧族人小孩
Lanthanite child.

831
00:49:23,161 --> 00:49:24,360
什么
Wha--

832
00:49:24,360 --> 00:49:26,540
要不换他也行
Perhaps I take him instead?

833
00:49:27,640 --> 00:49:29,040
或者换他
Or him?

834
00:49:29,700 --> 00:49:31,920
敢伤害他们 下一个死的就是你
Hurt them and you die next.

835
00:49:35,240 --> 00:49:40,178
不舍得直接对你最喜欢的少尉动手 是吧
you couldn't kill your favorite ensign now, could you?

836
00:49:40,739 --> 00:49:42,513
救救我 求你了
Help, please.

837
00:49:43,340 --> 00:49:45,080
姆'本加医生 是我 真的是我
Dr. M'Benga, it's me, it's really me.

838
00:49:45,080 --> 00:49:46,284
不要伤害我
Don't hurt me.

839
00:49:46,600 --> 00:49:49,120
抵抗它 你能做到的
Fight it. You can fight it.

840
00:49:49,440 --> 00:49:51,656
不 约瑟夫 我觉得甘布尔已经不在了
No, Joseph, I don't think he's really in there.

841
00:49:53,424 --> 00:49:55,660
他还在
He is.

842
00:49:57,795 --> 00:50:01,332
放了那孩子 求你了
Let the boy go. Please.

843
00:50:02,200 --> 00:50:03,601
占据我的身体吧
Take me.

844
00:50:08,380 --> 00:50:09,140
别
不

845
00:50:25,123 --> 00:50:27,125
你把它传送到哪了
W-Where did you send it?

846
00:50:27,225 --> 00:50:28,459
哪都没传去
Nowhere.

847
00:50:41,672 --> 00:50:44,342
多亏佩利亚和斯考特中尉的随机应变
Thanks to Pelia and Lieutenant Scott's quick thinking,

848
00:50:44,342 --> 00:50:47,011
我们应该不会再见到邪灵了
we should not be seeing the Vezda again.

849
00:50:47,640 --> 00:50:48,960
你确定这能困住它吗
Are you sure it'll hold?

850
00:50:48,960 --> 00:50:50,648
在得到有关这个生命体更多信息之前
Until we learn more about this entity,

851
00:50:50,960 --> 00:50:52,817
既然送不回那个多维监狱
the transport buffer is the best proxy we have

852
00:50:52,817 --> 00:50:54,640
传送缓存器是我们最好的替代方案了
for a layered dimensional prison.

853
00:50:54,899 --> 00:50:56,179
剩下的那些怎么办
What about the rest of them?

854
00:50:56,179 --> 00:50:58,123
星际舰队和玛克戎人正在合作
Starfleet and the M'Kroon are already working together

855
00:50:58,123 --> 00:51:00,520
在遗址周围建立安全防线
to establish a security perimeter around the site.

856
00:51:00,520 --> 00:51:02,019
看来他们开始意识到
Apparently, they're starting to see

857
00:51:02,019 --> 00:51:03,961
加入联邦的好处了
the benefits of the Federation.

858
00:51:05,230 --> 00:51:07,998
要知道 如果甘布尔少尉
You know, if Ensign Gamble, or...

859
00:51:07,998 --> 00:51:09,880
或者说附身他的生命体
rather, the entity inside of him,

860
00:51:09,880 --> 00:51:11,260
当初控制了舰载相位炮系统
had taken hold of the ship's phaser banks...

861
00:51:11,260 --> 00:51:12,870
他差点就能释放所有的邪灵了
He could have set them all free.

862
00:51:14,205 --> 00:51:18,943
你们能想象这样一支宇宙生物大军在银河系肆虐吗
An army of cosmic beings like that set loose on the galaxy?

863
00:51:20,911 --> 00:51:24,449
我很抱歉 医生 我理解你很喜欢那孩子
I'm sorry, Doctor, I know you were fond of the boy,

864
00:51:24,549 --> 00:51:26,351
但他已经不在了
but he was gone.

865
00:51:27,520 --> 00:51:28,780
它们是邪恶的吗 舰长
Were they evil, Captain?

866
00:51:30,721 --> 00:51:32,390
我看过甘布尔的行动记录
I saw the recordings of what Gamble did,

867
00:51:32,390 --> 00:51:33,740
和他说过的话
and the things he said.

868
00:51:33,740 --> 00:51:35,942
世上没有绝对的善恶 孩子
Good and evil are relative terms, son.

869
00:51:36,800 --> 00:51:41,332
胡说 宇宙中存在绝对邪恶
Nonsense. There is evil in this universe,

870
00:51:41,760 --> 00:51:43,734
正如存在绝对的善良
as sure as there is good.

871
00:51:44,940 --> 00:51:50,200
就像世上存在物质 存在光明一样
A-As sure as there is matter, as sure as there is light.

872
00:51:50,976 --> 00:51:53,144
我能感受到
I know...

873
00:51:53,144 --> 00:51:57,215
那个存在非常古老
that being was ancient.

874
00:51:58,483 --> 00:51:59,980
充满恶意
Malevolent.

875
00:52:00,933 --> 00:52:04,722
那种要将世界全部扭曲 腐化
The desire to malign, to pervert...

876
00:52:04,722 --> 00:52:06,800
吞噬的欲望
and consume,

877
00:52:06,800 --> 00:52:09,194
凝聚成了实体
given corporeal form.

878
00:52:10,827 --> 00:52:13,731
如果那些东西
If any of those things...

879
00:52:13,731 --> 00:52:17,268
但凡有一个逃出了那地方
ever escape that well down there...

880
00:52:19,237 --> 00:52:20,971
只能愿上帝保佑了
...God help us all.

881
00:52:26,010 --> 00:52:28,145
你要给它拍张照吗
You want one for the camera?

882
00:52:30,915 --> 00:52:31,949
不用了
No.

883
00:52:31,949 --> 00:52:33,584
不用了 谢谢
No, I'm good. Thank you.

884
00:52:34,852 --> 00:52:36,821
随你便
Suit yourself.

885
00:52:45,900 --> 00:52:47,180
姆'本加医生
Dr. M'Benga?

886
00:52:47,180 --> 00:52:49,160
联系地球的子空间通讯频道已接通
I have the subspace relay to Earth.

887
00:52:49,160 --> 00:52:51,336
谢谢 把通话交给我吧
Thank you. I've got it from here.

888
00:52:54,039 --> 00:52:59,210
您好 我是进取号的约瑟夫·姆'本加医生
Hello, I'm Dr. Joseph M'Benga of the USS Enterprise.

889
00:52:59,210 --> 00:53:01,579
我请求与您通话
I've asked to be the one to call you.

890
00:53:02,660 --> 00:53:04,915
是关于您儿子
It's about your son,

891
00:53:04,915 --> 00:53:06,817
戴纳·甘布尔的事
Dana Gamble.

